WEBVTT

00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:30.336
I was trapped in a cage,
prey among predators,

00:03:30.360 --> 00:03:32.256
fighting for freedom I never had.

00:03:32.280 --> 00:03:34.456
I was lost, tired,

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:35.840
and I was out of options.

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:38.776
So at 20 years old,

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:41.320
I did the hardest thing
I'd ever done in my life.

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:43.360
I picked up a book,

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:47.880
and it was the most agonizing
time of my life,

00:03:49.320 --> 00:03:51.136
trying to learn how to read,

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:53.776
the ostracizing from my family,

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:55.000
the homeys.

00:03:56.280 --> 00:03:57.736
It was rough, man.

00:03:57.760 --> 00:03:59.136
It was a struggle.

00:03:59.160 --> 00:04:00.856
But little did I know